#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:52
msgid ""
"Once you've submitted an issue via email, you should receive an "
"acknowledgment within 48 hours."
msgstr ""
"När du har skickat in ett ärende via e-post bör du få en bekräftelse inom 48"
" timmar."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/security.html:54
msgid ""
"Depending on the action to be taken, you may receive further follow-up "
"emails."
msgstr ""
"Beroende på vilken åtgärd som ska vidtas kan du få fler uppföljande "
"e-postmeddelanden."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:29
msgid ""
"The Python Software Foundation raises and distributes funds to improve "
"Python's packaging ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"Python Software Foundation samlar in och fördelar medel för att förbättra "
"Pythons ekosystem för paketering."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:34
msgid ""
"The successful relaunch of the Python Package Index, powered by the new "
"'Warehouse' codebase"
msgstr ""
"Den lyckade nylanseringen av Python Package Index med den nya kodbasen "
"”Warehouse”"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:36
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With <a href=\"%(project_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">$170,000 in funding</a> from the <a "
"href=\"%(funder_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Mozilla Open Source Support Program</a> in 2018"
msgstr ""
"Med <a href=\"%(project_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">170 000 dollar i finansiering</a> från <a "
"href=\"%(funder_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Mozilla Open Source Support Program</a> under 2018"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:45
msgid ""
"Improving PyPI's security and accessibility, and adding support for multiple"
" locales"
msgstr ""
"Förbättrad säkerhet och tillgänglighet i PyPI samt stöd för flera "
"språkversioner"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:47
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With $80,000 in funding from the <a href=\"%(funder_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Technology "
"Fund</a> in 2019"
msgstr ""
"Med 80 000 dollar i finansiering från <a href=\"%(funder_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Technology "
"Fund</a> under 2019"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:55
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With <a href=\"%(project_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">$100,000 in funding</a> from <a href=\"%(funder_href)s\" "
"title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Facebook Research</a>"
" in 2019 and 2020"
msgstr ""
"Med <a href=\"%(project_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">100 000 dollar i finansiering</a> från <a "
"href=\"%(funder_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Facebook Research</a> under 2019 och 2020"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:66
#, python-format
msgid ""
"With <a href=\"%(project_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">$407,000 in funding</a> from the <a "
"href=\"%(funder0_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Chan Zuckerberg Initiative</a> and the <a "
"href=\"%(funder1_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Mozilla Open Source Support Program</a> in 2020"
msgstr ""
"Med <a href=\"%(project_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">407 000 dollar i finansiering</a> från <a "
"href=\"%(funder0_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Chan Zuckerberg Initiative</a> och <a "
"href=\"%(funder1_href)s\" title=\"%(title)s\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener\">Mozilla Open Source Support Program</a> under 2020"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:79
msgid ""
"With your support, the PSF can continue to fund packaging improvements, "
"benefiting millions of Python users around the world."
msgstr ""
"Med ditt stöd kan PSF fortsätta finansiera förbättringar av paketeringen, "
"till nytta för miljontals Python-användare världen över."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:91
msgid ""
"All of these initiatives help maintain and support the tools that the Python"
" community uses daily. This work can only be done with the generous "
"financial support that you or your organization provides."
msgstr ""
"Alla dessa initiativ bidrar till att underhålla och stödja verktygen som "
"Python-gemenskapen använder varje dag. Arbetet kan bara genomföras med det "
"generösa ekonomiska stöd som du eller organisationen ger."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:93
msgid ""
"Your contributions matter and they make an impact. Every donation counts!"
msgstr "Ditt bidrag spelar roll och gör skillnad. Varje donation räknas!"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:101
msgid ""
"The PSF is recognized by the IRS as a 501(c)(3) non-profit charitable "
"organization, and donations are tax-deductible for organizations that pay "
"taxes in the United States."
msgstr ""
"IRS erkänner PSF som en ideell välgörenhetsorganisation enligt 501(c)(3) och"
" donationer är avdragsgilla för organisationer som betalar skatt i USA."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:113
msgid ""
"Looking for brand visibility? In the last year*, 21.1 million people from "
"237 countries visited PyPI.org."
msgstr ""
"Vill du synas med varumärket? Under det senaste året* besökte 21,1 miljoner "
"personer från 237 länder PyPI.org."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:122
msgid ""
"Funds raised by the Python Software Foundation go directly towards improving"
" the tools your company uses every day."
msgstr ""
"Medel som Python Software Foundation samlar in går direkt till att förbättra"
" verktygen som företaget använder varje dag."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/sponsors.html:127
msgid ""
"Enhance your company's reputation by investing in Python and the open source"
" community."
msgstr ""
"Stärk företagets anseende genom att investera i Python och gemenskapen för "
"öppen källkod."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/stats.html:24
msgid ""
"PyPI provides public datasets, including download statistics and metadata "
"via BigQuery"
msgstr ""
"PyPI tillhandahåller offentliga datamängder med bland annat "
"nedladdningsstatistik och metadata via BigQuery"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/stats.html:29
msgid ""
"PyPI provides a public dashboard with statistics on usage and performance"
msgstr ""
"PyPI tillhandahåller en offentlig instrumentpanel med statistik om "
"användning och prestanda"

#: warehouse/templates/pages/stats.html:35
msgid ""
"These statistics are provided by other third-party services unaffiliated "
"with PyPI."
msgstr ""
"Statistiken tillhandahålls av andra tredjepartstjänster som inte är knutna "
"till PyPI."

#: warehouse/templates/pages/stats.html:55
msgid ""
"Here is a list of the top 100 projects based on the sum of their packages' "
"sizes (in bytes). This page is cached for 24 hours, so don't expect the "
"numbers to be realtime."
msgstr ""
"Här är en lista över de 100 största projekten utifrån den sammanlagda "
"storleken på deras paket i byte. Sidan cachelagras i 24 timmar, så räkna "
"inte med att siffrorna är aktuella i realtid."
